<tr>
<td class="post-text" style="font-size: 17px; font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1.75; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px; padding: 0 3.5%;">
<p>AI spending is eclipsing salaries at some companies, and execs are starting to notice. Today's AI+ is 887 words, a 3.5-minute read.</p><p>👀 <strong>Situational awareness: </strong>Jury selection begins today in Elon Musk's lawsuit against Sam Altman over OpenAI's shift to a for-profit model.</p><ul><li><strong>Why it matters: </strong>This case goes to the heart of one of the most consequential questions in AI: whether a company can pivot toward profit without betraying its original mission, and who gets to decide.</li></ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="10" style="height: 10px; font-size: 0; border-bottom: 10px solid #f5f5f5;"> </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="10" style="height: 10px; font-size: 0;"> </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 20px 3.5% 10px; line-height: 1.5;">
<span class="bodytext hed" style="font-size: 27px; font-family: 'gorditamedium', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222; letter-spacing: -0.1px; line-height: 1.5;">
1 big thing: AI can cost more than human workers now
</span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0 3.5% 10px; line-height: 1.5;">
<span class="bodytext" style="font-size:13px;font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#333335">
By <a class="card-byline" href="https://www.axios.com/authors/mmills?stream=top" style="font-size:13px;font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#333335">Madison Mills</a>
</span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="10" style="height: 10px; font-size: 0;"> </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<img alt="A futuristic scene featuring a humanoid robot sitting in a chair at a modern desk, working on a glowing high-tech computer. The robot is focused on a digital interface displayed on the screen. The background is a teal color with geometric shapes, creating a digital and modern atmosphere." id="item02" src="https://images.axios.com/XlIsl7Uk9diwAOpDGEhx-zBXg1w=/0x0:1920x1080/1920x1080/2025/07/02/1751484371498.jpeg" style="width:100%" width="600"/>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td height="10" style="height: 10px; font-size: 0;"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0 3.5%; line-height: 1.3;">
<span class="bodytext" style="font-size: 13px; color: #848484;">
<p>Illustration: Aïda Amer/Axios</p>
</span>
</td>
